# Champa project map

Single-merchant IT hardware shop + services desk + admin portal. Stack: Vite/React/TS, Supabase, Stripe Checkout, Capacitor iOS. Docs: `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/CODING_PRINCIPLES.md`, `docs/FEATURE_MAP.md`.

## Before coding

1. Open `docs/FEATURE_MAP.md` and read **only** the domain you are changing.
2. Apply that section’s owners, then the **cross-cutting checklist** (page, route in `App.tsx`, nav, i18n en+lo, migration/RLS, admin, Edge Function, email registry, badges, iOS chrome).
3. Do not search the whole repo or read all of `src/integrations/supabase/types.ts` to find owners.

## Folder ownership

- `src/pages/`, `src/pages/admin/` — screens
- `src/components/` — app UI; `src/components/ui/` — shadcn only
- `src/context/` — auth, cart, language
- `src/lib/` — helpers; `src/types/` — shared domain types
- `supabase/migrations/` — append-only schema + RLS
- `supabase/functions/` — secrets and privileged work
- `ios/`, `src/lib/native.ts`, safe-area CSS — native shell ([AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md))

## Hard rules

- Products ≠ services. Do not invent Stripe Connect.
- Money / delete-account / email → Edge Functions via `supabase.functions.invoke`.
- Match existing patterns; keep diffs focused.
